<style>
.radio-group { margin-bottom: 1.2rem; }
.radio-group h6 { font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: #1e293b; }
.radio { margin-bottom: 0.3rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem; }
.radio input { margin: 0; }
</style>

<div class="practice-page">
  <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back to exercises</a>
  <h1 class="practice-title">Radio Buttons</h1>
  <div class="practice-banner"><ul>
    <li>Select a radio button using <code>click()</code> and verify with <code>isSelected()</code></li>
    <li>Assert only one radio per group can be selected at a time</li>
    <li>Handle disabled radio buttons — verify they cannot be clicked</li>
    <li>Use <code>findElements()</code> to count all radios in a group</li>
  </ul></div>

  <div class="radio-group">
    <h6>Select your favorite color:</h6>
    <div class="radio"><input type="radio" id="blue" name="color" checked><label for="blue">Blue</label></div>
    <div class="radio"><input type="radio" id="red" name="color"><label for="red">Red</label></div>
    <div class="radio"><input type="radio" id="yellow" name="color"><label for="yellow">Yellow</label></div>
    <div class="radio"><input type="radio" id="black" name="color"><label for="black">Black</label></div>
    <div class="radio"><input type="radio" id="green" name="color" disabled><label for="green" style="opacity:0.4">Green</label></div>
  </div>

  <div class="radio-group">
    <h6>Select your favorite sport:</h6>
    <div class="radio"><input type="radio" id="basketball" name="sport"><label for="basketball">Basketball</label></div>
    <div class="radio"><input type="radio" id="football" name="sport"><label for="football">Football</label></div>
    <div class="radio"><input type="radio" id="hockey" name="sport"><label for="hockey">Hockey</label></div>
    <div class="radio"><input type="radio" id="soccer" name="sport"><label for="soccer">Soccer</label></div>
  </div>

  <div class="radio-group">
    <h6>Do you like the site?</h6>
    <div class="radio"><input type="radio" id="yesRadio" name="like"><label for="yesRadio">Yes</label></div>
    <div class="radio"><input type="radio" id="impressiveRadio" name="like"><label for="impressiveRadio">Impressive</label></div>
    <div class="radio"><input type="radio" id="noRadio" name="like" disabled><label for="noRadio" style="opacity:0.4">No</label></div>
  </div>
</div>
